{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-izzzi-life-mint","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"izzzi-life-mint-orangelife-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Izzzi Life Mint is a modern five-storey apartment complex located in the dynamic Jumeirah Village Circle area of Dubai.This stylish house from the developer DMS offers a choice of luxury apartments: studios, one-bedroom and two-bedroom apartments. Izzzi Life Mint is distinguished by its unique architectural forms and refined design, which makes it stand out from other residential complexes.In total, the complex offers 115 apartments of three categories: for one person or a couple, as well as spacious apartments for families with children. The interior of the apartment is designed with special attention to detail to ensure maximum comfort and aesthetic pleasure. Each apartment has a balcony or terrace.Residents of the complex can use the services of an extensive internal infrastructure, including shops, cafes and green areas for recreation. Near the complex there is a transport interchange, which makes it easy to get to any point of the city or airport, both by private and public transport. Residents are also provided with a 24-hour reception, underground parking, security, a swimming pool, a children's pool, a sports hall, an open-air cinema, coworking and games areas, as well as a closed territory.Various infrastructure facilities are located in the immediate vicinity of the complex. Trade Centre Metro Station is a 5-minute walk away, while Museum of the Future and Al Satwa Park are a 10 — minute walk away. La Mer Beach is 15 minutes ' walk away.","price":594118,"title":"Izzzi Life Mint","bitrix":{"id":714,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Izzzi Life Mint","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Izzzi Life Mint","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Orange.Life","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)"},"im